(text "SINGLE AUDIO-COMMON / CHASSIS BOND (physical star point)" (at 45 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid aa81ec9a-8170-56f4-99f7-e4aa0912eaca))
(text "PE inlet bonds directly to chassis and exposed metal. Audio common bonds once at the star.\nPCB/control/audio return routing must preserve this physical wiring intent.\nRevised heater load = 6 x 0.3A + 2 x 1.5A = 4.8A, plus pilot and tolerances.\nArtificial centre tap references HEAT_A/B to HREF; do not also ground a real heater centre tap.\nT1 unused 5V winding, if fitted: individually insulate every lead; do not connect to this circuit." (at 18 218 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) ) (justify left top)) (uuid 9a038df0-e26a-56e6-acd2-3145864863c3))
